1100/extras/2ee81775453161e1ce7df1037573faea.webm?t=1764562464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/2ee81775453161e1ce7df1037573faea.mp4?t=1764562464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Every run presents fresh challenges through randomized encounters and branching paths. Face strategic challenges that demand adaptation, not memorization. Navigate through dangerous place, discover hidden synergies, and build your perfect combination. The game respects your intelligence\u2014minimal tutorials, maximum discovery.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die, Learn, Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/5fbb6ea3eb4f430289230add499c9587.poster.avif?t=1764562464\" width=284 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/5fbb6ea3eb4f430289230add499c9587.webm?t=1764562464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/5fbb6ea3eb4f430289230add499c9587.mp4?t=1764562464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each defeat teaches you new strategies, and reveals hidden synergies. No grinding required\u2014unlockables fundamentally change how you approach each run, offering genuinely new experiences rather than mere stat boosts. </p>","developers":["Stochastic Walk"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/2fa25e1379b6c2978fcc1b8a17c442623c190016/header.jpg?t=1764562464","is_free":false,"linux_r