/ss_2c5056b87730e563e8a62e355f274d16be9178f1.600x338.jpg?t=1764562464"}],"short_description":"Match Morphosis is a Roguelike Match-3 Deckbuilder. Match your tiles to defeat enemies, gain artifacts to build synergies and unleash powerful combos. Master your way in this unique turn-based RPG. Kill, death, unlock, repeat. No two runs are the same, no timers, no grinding, no mercy.","steam_appid":4131100,"support_info":{"email":"info.stocwalk@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}